title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer on "This track" (stops at the end of the track that plays, its last 10 s fading), then "This album or queue" and Off: a choice closes the page and the Menu shows the mode (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm: ROW 44, the approved 480x320 layout's volume group and seek row 43 px (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE sleep
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP track

wait 900
shot 01-sleep-track
expect text "Stops at the end of this track. The music fades out for its last 10 seconds."
# a choice closes the page (owner-approved): the Menu shows the mode
tap "This album or queue"
wait 400
shot 02-menu-album
expect text "This album"
tap "Sleep timer"
wait 400
shot 03-sleep-album
expect text "Stops at the end of this album or queue. The music fades out for its last 10 seconds."
tap "Off"
wait 400
shot 04-menu-off
expect text "Off"
expect notext "Stops at the end of this album or queue. The music fades out for its last 10 seconds."
expect noquit
